cil where local teens help develop museum programming.","evidence_claim":"Demuth Museum of Art states that its Teen Art Council is entirely free and is designed for local high-school students.","source_url":"https://www.demuth.org/opportunities","source_title":"Opportunities — Demuth Museum of Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Limited to accepted local high-school students; the program runs October–June and requires an application.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Phillips Museum of Art is seasonally closed until September 8, 2026.","Demuth Museum of Art on Lime closes between exhibitions; visitors should confirm the exhibition calendar.","Demuth Teen Art Council is eligibility-limited and application-based."]}],"warnings":[]}
